            "created_at": "2025-08-01T19:45:05.590883+00:00",
            "notes": "With round 5, you have the ability to get hella aggressive. Double booping people into walls is now exceptionally effective and with the addition of Mark of the Kitsune, your shots immediately after booping do a nice healthy chunk of damage. \n\nBoop  Shoot  Boop  Shoot  Melee is a great combo to just burst a squishy down. \n\nAt this point, you can do whatever you want and it's difficult not to. The discipline to not just live in the backline and to continue your gameplay loop from the prior two rounds is what will make or break your round here. Go in, but make sure to get back out. You now just have the ability to do it much more aggressively.\n\nNumber 1 single feels pretty meh by this point so I removed it from the option items list.",
